              "value": "Stunning Screech"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, fear, mental)\n\nThe terror shrike unleashes a haunting screech that causes prey to freeze in fear. Each creature in a 30-foot emanation other than terror birds must attempt a 19 Will save.\n\nRegardless of the result, creatures are then temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is flat-footed until the start of its turn.\n- **Failure:** The creature is stunned 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is stunned 2."
            },
